Branch 'dev' is currently held by 'locked-tree'.
Free branch 'dev' without deleting the 'locked-tree' directory.
Check out 'dev' in a new worktree at '../patch'.
Commit a change to 'patch/b.c' with the word 'patch' in the message.
Exit the subshell.

Tidbit: 'git worktree list' displays all active worktrees and their
assigned branches. Detaching HEAD in the occupying tree frees the
branch reference immediately.
